{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180058-flowers-of-hell-the-demon-player-s-guide-errata-thread","id":180058,"title":"Flowers of Hell: The Demon Player's Guide errata thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-25T14:14:47-07:00","id":180058,"title":"Flowers of Hell: The Demon Player's Guide errata thread","content":"If you find any typos or visual glitches in <i>Flowers of Hell</i>, please report them here. Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T16:05:39-07:00","id":180139,"title":"","content":"Seemingly accidental question mark in intro fiction's &quot;tuxedo magnate&quot; sidebar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T16:34:01-07:00","id":180160,"title":"","content":"Just been flipping through it so far, but at the bottom of page 39, under Changing Agendas:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;... <b>tit</b> requires giving up a level of control that has been their best protection up to that point. <b>hat</b> sort of vulnerability is never easy.&quot; </div> </div> </div>I believe it should be:<br /> <br /> &quot;it requires giving up a level of control that has been their best protection up to that point. That sort of vulnerability is never easy.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1449-zakariya-ali-sher","name":"Zakariya Ali Sher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T19:46:30-07:00","id":180286,"title":"","content":"Page 46: &quot;The <b>Integrators'</b> methods of information gathering[\u2026]&quot; should be &quot;[\u2026] the <b>Inquisitors'</b> methods[\u2026]&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 52: Typo - &quot;For <b>an Inquisitors</b>, having another supernatural being[\u2026]&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 06-26-2014, 12:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T23:38:00-07:00","id":180472,"title":"","content":"Page 175: &quot;When using the tool for its intended purpose, it offers an equipment bonus of +3; any improvised use of the tool suffers an additional <b>(square?)2</b> modifier. [...]&quot; (It did come up as the expected -2 when copy/pasted so it <i>may</i> be a bug with my PDF reader.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T13:01:33-07:00","id":181178,"title":"","content":"Page 70: Typo - &quot;[\u2026]stealing <b>materiel</b> and personnel away[\u2026]&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 72: &quot;Dice pool&quot; blurb under Systems for Analyzing Infrastructure says examples of Infrastructure are <b>later</b> in the chapter; these examples are in the section immediately preceding this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 06-26-2014, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T13:30:30-07:00","id":181192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180058-flowers-of-hell-the-demon-player-s-guide-errata-thread?p=181178#post181178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Page 70: Typo - &quot;[\u2026]stealing <b>materiel</b> and personnel away[\u2026]&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 72: &quot;Dice pool&quot; blurb under Systems for Analyzing Infrastructure says examples of Infrastructure are <b>later</b> in the chapter; these examples are in the section immediately preceding this one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Materiel is a real word that means &quot;military supplies&quot; <a href=\"http://www.macmillandictionary.com/us/dictionary/american/materiel\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.macmillandictionary.com/u...rican/materiel</a> I even put a note to the editor that I'd used it deliberately!<br /> <br /> And... Uh.. When I wrote it, the examples <i>were</i> after the rules. Matt must have cut it in half and swapped it to make it fit better with other people's drafts.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T15:45:29-07:00","id":181302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180058-flowers-of-hell-the-demon-player-s-guide-errata-thread?p=181192#post181192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Materiel is a real word that means &quot;military supplies&quot; <a href=\"http://www.macmillandictionary.com/us/dictionary/american/materiel\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.macmillandictionary.com/u...rican/materiel</a> I even put a note to the editor that I'd used it deliberately!</div> </div> </div> </div>Learnin' new words! \\o/<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And... Uh.. When I wrote it, the examples <i>were</i> after the rules. Matt must have cut it in half and swapped it to make it fit better with other people's drafts. </div> </div> </div>Thought it might be something like that; still, that's why we have the thread.<br /> <br /> Page 83: Typo - &quot;Every demon is a perfect liar on the run <b>for</b> a merciless god[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>from</b>.<br /> Page 83: Typo - &quot;It's possible that emotional <b>bounds</b> and experience[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>bonds</b>.<br /> Page 84: Missing <b>to</b> between the following sentence's bolded words, uncapitalized &quot;a&quot; in &quot;Agency&quot; - &quot;Beyond that, a budding <b>a</b>gency <b>needs rub</b> elbows, make friends[\u2026]&quot;<br /> Page 88: &quot;[\u2026]potential recruits still want to know <b>what has the ring done lately.</b>&quot; - should be <b>what the ring has done lately.</b><br /> Page 89: Typo - &quot;Have the largest <b>cyptoflora</b> garden in the world.&quot; - should be <b>cryptoflora</b>.<br /> Page 93: Dropped or incorrect word - &quot;Too much of the process of slipping through gaps in the natural laws is a matter of doing<b> than </b>knowing.&quot; - should be <b>rather than</b> or <b>over</b>.<br /> Page 96: Typo - &quot;(typically a <b>Computers</b>, Larceny, or Academics roll).&quot; - should be <b>Computer</b>.<br /> Page 97: &quot;The victim is not allowed the normal Dexterity + Athletics roll to resist this Embed.&quot; - the mechanics of the power as written do not use a Dexterity + Athletics roll to resist it, instead subtracting Dexterity.<br /> Page 99: &quot;The maximum change in the equipment bonus is now +3 or -3.&quot; - the power does not describe its basic effect as a variable change with a maximum degree and instead describes a +1/-1 shift; possibly &quot;maximum&quot; should be deleted.<br /> Page 117: Word order error or extra word - &quot;[\u2026] a demon can assume <b>one the role of any of </b>the characters in the legend as a fa\u00e7ade Cover.&quot; - should be <b>the role of any one of </b>or <b>the role of any of</b>.<br /> Page 117: Typo - &quot;<b>Others</b> demons take advantage of the reputation[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>Other</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 06-27-2014, 02:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T05:40:35-07:00","id":181842,"title":"","content":"p.73 - the sidebar states that there are two modifiers for the Synchronizing roll (+2 for demonic form and penalty based on the Infrastructure type) and, if successful, four modifiers for the Analysing Infrastructure rolls (including +2 for output in the preceding 24 hours). However, the example on p.74 para 4 talks about the +2 modifier for output in the preceding 24 hours for the Syncronizing roll. Either that's not correct or the sidebar should mention that the 4 modifiers for the Analaysing Infrastructure roll are also available for the Synchronizing roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2108-genesis","name":"genesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T16:11:22-07:00","id":182339,"title":"","content":"Page 124: No duration is given for the effect of Abruption Jets. Guessing one turn per Aether spent.<br /> Page 128: Eliminator Cannon does not say which kind of action generating and firing a grenade is. Guessing instant.<br /> Page 128: Typo - &quot;However, in the <b>imoment</b>, she can shift[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>moment</b>.<br /> Page 141: Missing comma - &quot;The Ritornello have no limits to what they will do in their search for Hell, and even task demons with killing other <b>demons paying</b> for the deed with especially rare gadgets.&quot; - should be <b>demons, paying</b>.<br /> Page 141: Missing verb - &quot;[\u2026]demons are asked to perform all sorts of <b>tasks</b> in return for a gadget, <b>information</b> being the least.&quot; - Information is not a task.<br /> Page 144: Comma splice - &quot;Just as with creating a gadget, the energy fluctuation causes visual effects <b>as well, often these are</b> more intense[\u2026]&quot; - suggest replacing bolded comma with a semicolon.<br /> Page 152: Extra word - &quot;A few <b>of</b> Embedded gadgets use hardware that seems strange or downright bizarre.&quot;<br /> Page 153: &quot;A stigmatic or other character using a knock-off gains the Flagged Condition if a normal human sees her using it.&quot; - Flagged does not do anything to stigmatics; non-demons cannot spoof. Possibly replace with Surveilled?<br /> Page 156: &quot;For each dot above 2 the character has in the [Suborned Infrastructure] Merit[\u2026]&quot; - Suborned Infrastructure is a 1-3 dot Merit.<br /> Page 157: Extra/erroneous/missing/???? word - &quot;Forcing <b>so</b><b> personal</b> Aether into a gadget can give a demon several benefits.&quot;<br /> Page 157: Same problem as Page 153 - &quot;All drawbacks are permanent, and affect anyone using the gadget, rather than the original user. [\u2026] <b>Anyone using the gadget gains the Flagged Condition.</b>&quot;<br /> Page 158: Missing word - &quot;Each roll takes half an hour, and she needs successes equal <b>to hardware's </b>Structure.&quot; - should be <b>to the hardware's</b>.<br /> Page 158: Ambiguous wording - &quot;[\u2026]she doesn't attract the notice of angels when doing so.&quot; - suggest &quot;doing so doesn't attract the notice of angels.&quot; instead, to avoid the implication that repairing an overclocked gadget deflects angelic attention.<br /> Page 162: Visual glitch - minus sign in &quot;-3 penalty&quot; registers as a box in PDF reader, though copying and pasting produces &quot;\u22123 penalty&quot; normally.<br /> Page 163: &quot;First-order <b>gadgets</b> are tremendously volatile[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>lambdas</b>.<br /> Page 163: Visual glitch - same as Page 162.<br /> Page 164: Ambiguous wording - &quot;The demon can maintain the storm across a radius of about a hundred yards for every five successes rolled. <b>She can continue playing</b> to increase the area to a maximum of five hundred yards, <b>but gains the Flagged Condition if she does so.</b>&quot; - if &quot;does so&quot; refers to &quot;continue playing,&quot; what is the threshold for &quot;continue&quot;? Using the machine is an extended action.<br /> Page 169: Typo - &quot;[\u2026]his newly stolen Health absorbs the damage and <b>go</b> away.&quot; - should be <b>goes</b>.<br /> Page 171: Possible wrong word - &quot;[\u2026]a playing card with the <b>atomic </b>symbols for copper, iron, gold and silver instead of the normal suits.&quot; - atomic symbols are just collections of letters and numbers; the choice of metals suggests <b>alchemical</b> is the intended word.<br /> Page 174: Visual glitch - same as Page 162 and Page 163.<br /> Page 174: Wrong word - &quot;When the demon activates the Chaos <b>Mechanic</b>&quot; - should be <b>Engine</b>.<br /> Page 174: Missing word - &quot;Instead of choosing a target, he <b>can a</b> successful attack into a miss[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>can turn a</b>.<br /> Page 174: Extra word - &quot;[\u2026]or <b>turn or a</b> miss into a successful attack[\u2026]&quot; - should be <b>turn a</b>.<br /> Page 174: Visual glitch - same as earlier in page, this time with &quot;-2 penalty.&quot; - this appears in both the Dramatic Failure and Failure text for the Infinite Multitool.<br /> Page 175: Typo - &quot;Weapons created by the Infinite Multitool have a weapon bonus of 2 but <b>reduces</b> the wielder's Initiative by 2.&quot; - should be <b>reduce</b>.<br /> Page 175: Comma splice - &quot;Attaching each end to <b>clothing is fine, the chain doesn't</b> have to make skin contact.&quot; - suggest replacing bolded comma with a semicolon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 06-28-2014, 04:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T20:53:15-07:00","id":184427,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\">Page 109: Incorrect Word - &quot;He can alter pitch, <b>timber</b>, quality, and tone, perfectly impersonate another person, or even impersonate multiple people speaking at once.&quot; - Should be timbre, as I doubt we're giving the demons powers to speak wood from their mouth.<br /> Page 151: Unusual Spacing - &quot;has Cost \u2022\u2022\u2022, or Cost \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 for Exploited gadgets.&quot; The space after &quot;Cost \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022&quot; is quite large and looks strange.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","user":"Xenesis","date":". 06-30-2014, 01:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T18:20:09-07:00","id":185280,"title":"","content":"Page 127: Example collision attack made with the Tread Propulsion is out of line with the cited &quot;Car Wrecks&quot; section of Demon's Appendix copy of the GMC Rules Update. Example attack deals bashing damage and applies Size as automatic damage; appendix says vehicle collisions deal lethal damage and notes that damage is determined by rolling Size and adding a bonus success for each 20mph (i.e. 28 points of Speed).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T18:26:43-07:00","id":185284,"title":"","content":"Just a quick one: PDF bookmarks. &quot;New Merits&quot; and &quot;Integrity and Breaking Points&quot; are collapsed under Demonic Form Abilities in their corresponding chapter, probably automatically assigned because DFA gets a big header and there is no corresponding header to break it up for &quot;other things.&quot; They don't thematically relate, though, and a quick check for these sections probably won't think to look under demonic form, so I'd suggest they should probably be bumped up a level in the bookmark ladder. Similarly, the sections on Agendas, rings, the Fall and the Descent probably shouldn't be filed as subsets of the section on pacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T22:35:28-07:00","id":186830,"title":"","content":"Page 153: Wrong word - &quot;To that end, he puts together a gadget to allow his ally to access <b>Downloadable</b> Knowledge.&quot; - should be <b>Download</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T18:35:58-07:00","id":187564,"title":"","content":"Page 156-157: Several options for crafting gadgets within Suborned Infrastructure are given, but the instructions state &quot;For each dot above 2 the character has in the Merit&quot;, while the Merit as listed in the Core (<u>Demon: the Descent</u>, p.121) only goes up to 3. Is the Merit misprinted, or is the wording wrong in <u>Flowers</u>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T16:49:58-07:00","id":189700,"title":"","content":"Second page of Table of Contents: Floating right-parentheses after &quot;Sympathetic Demon.&quot;","signature":"